{
  "schema": "cablesim.plugin/2",
  "id": "cablesim.type-electrical",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "name": "型号电气参数与短路容量",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "description": "按原文核验的 IEC 60287 与 IEC 60949 分支计算，缺项和未覆盖保留；使用不可变宿主运行快照。",
  "publisher": {
    "id": "cablesim",
    "name": "CableSimPro"
  },
  "host_api": {
    "major": 2,
    "min_minor": 1
  },
  "license": {
    "spdx": "LicenseRef-Project-Undeclared",
    "review_required": false
  },
  "platforms": [
    "windows-x64",
    "linux-x64",
    "darwin-arm64",
    "darwin-x64"
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "kind": "python",
    "python": ">=3.11,<3.14",
    "entry": "src/cablesim_type_electrical/main.py"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "study.run",
    "artifact.write"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "resources": {
    "timeout_s": 10,
    "memory_mb": 128,
    "network": "none"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "id": "electrical",
      "kind": "method",
      "title": "型号电气参数（IEC 60287 原文分支）",
      "method_version": "TYPE-ELECTRICAL-0.3.0",
      "analysis": "properties",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.domain/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.type-analysis.available-count",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.type-electrical",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "unverified",
        "cases": []
      },
      "limitations": [
        "只覆盖单芯或三芯的明确圆导体；R20、工作温度、系数、排列和运行电压必须有来源，缺项不推测。",
        "三芯电阻和电容按明确的长度基准与成缆绞入系数换算；邻近公式 x_p > 2.8 拒算。",
        "复用领域接地拓扑契约；完整电感、正序与零序阻抗的求解尚未覆盖；几何电感明确不含金属回路及大地返回。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "short-circuit",
      "kind": "method",
      "title": "组件绝热与非绝热短路容量（IEC 60949）",
      "method_version": "TYPE-SHORT-CIRCUIT-0.2.0",
      "analysis": "short_circuit",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.domain/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.type-analysis.available-count",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.type-short-circuit",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "unverified",
        "cases": []
      },
      "limitations": [
        "初始、最终温度与持续时间明确给定且带来源；计算条件不代表产品获准达到该温度。",
        "导体非绝热修正仅覆盖铜 / 铝与 XLPE；金属组件需截面、实际构造、接触条件与两侧介质热参数。",
        "隔离铜丝只覆盖完全嵌入且间隔至少一个丝径；反向扎带容量、未核实的接触分支与并联金属回路的总容量未覆盖。",
        "IEC 60949:1988 英文公开原文页摘录及 AMD1:2008 已逐图核验；未持有完整双语出版物，不作完整产品认证。"
      ]
    }
  ],
